{
  "sourceLanguage": "fr",
  "version": "1.0",
  "strings": {
    "branchement voulu, défait dans JACK": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verbindung gewollt, in JACK aufgehoben"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "wanted connection, undone in JACK"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "conexión deseada, deshecha en JACK"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "collegamento voluto, disfatto in JACK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "connexion faite ailleurs": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "anderswo hergestellte Verbindung"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "connection made elsewhere"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "conexión hecha en otro lugar"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "connessione fatta altrove"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Voulu, mais la connexion a été défaite dans JACK par un autre outil. Un clic retire ce branchement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gewollt, aber die Verbindung wurde in JACK von einem anderen Programm aufgehoben. Ein Klick entfernt sie aus deinen Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wanted, but another tool undid this connection in JACK. A click removes it from your connections."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deseada, pero otra herramienta deshizo la conexión en JACK. Un clic la quita de tus conexiones."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voluta, ma un altro strumento ha disfatto la connessione in JACK. Un clic la rimuove dai tuoi collegamenti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cette connexion existe dans JACK, faite par un autre outil, mais n'est pas dans le branchement. Un clic l'ajoute.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diese Verbindung besteht in JACK, wurde von einem anderen Programm hergestellt und gehört nicht zu deinen Verbindungen. Ein Klick fügt sie hinzu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This connection exists in JACK, made by another tool, but is not among your connections. A click adds it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta conexión existe en JACK, hecha por otra herramienta, pero no está entre tus conexiones. Un clic la añade."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Questa connessione esiste in JACK, fatta da un altro strumento, ma non è tra i tuoi collegamenti. Un clic la aggiunge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 connexion faite par un autre outil (anneau orange) : un clic l'ajoute au branchement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 Verbindung von einem anderen Programm hergestellt (oranger Ring): Ein Klick übernimmt sie in deine Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 connection made by another tool (orange ring): a click adds it to your connections."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 conexión hecha por otra herramienta (anillo naranja): un clic la añade a tus conexiones."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 connessione fatta da un altro strumento (anello arancione): un clic la aggiunge ai tuoi collegamenti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld connexions faites par un autre outil (anneaux orange) : un clic les ajoute au branchement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld Verbindungen von einem anderen Programm hergestellt (orange Ringe): Ein Klick übernimmt sie in deine Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld connections made by another tool (orange rings): a click adds them to your connections."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld conexiones hechas por otra herramienta (anillos naranjas): un clic las añade a tus conexiones."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld connessioni fatte da un altro strumento (anelli arancioni): un clic le aggiunge ai tuoi collegamenti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1 connexion du branchement a été défaite dans JACK (cercle en pointillés) : un clic la retire du branchement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 deiner Verbindungen wurde in JACK aufgehoben (gepunkteter Kreis): Ein Klick entfernt sie aus deinen Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 of your connections was undone in JACK (dotted circle): a click removes it from your connections."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 de tus conexiones se deshizo en JACK (círculo punteado): un clic la quita de tus conexiones."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1 dei tuoi collegamenti è stato disfatto in JACK (cerchio tratteggiato): un clic lo rimuove dai tuoi collegamenti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld connexions du branchement ont été défaites dans JACK (cercles en pointillés) : un clic les retire du branchement.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld deiner Verbindungen wurden in JACK aufgehoben (gepunktete Kreise): Ein Klick entfernt sie aus deinen Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld of your connections were undone in JACK (dotted circles): a click removes them from your connections."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld de tus conexiones se deshicieron en JACK (círculos punteados): un clic las quita de tus conexiones."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%lld dei tuoi collegamenti sono stati disfatti in JACK (cerchi tratteggiati): un clic li rimuove dai tuoi collegamenti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
