    "Joindre le récepteur": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reach receiver"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Empfänger erreichen"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Raggiungere il ricevitore"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alcanzar el receptor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'adresse de l'autre Mac (adresse IP ou nom de machine), ou une adresse de groupe de multidiffusion pour plusieurs récepteurs.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The address of the other Mac (IP address or host name), or a multicast group address for several receivers."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Adresse des anderen Macs (IP-Adresse oder Rechnername) oder eine Multicast-Gruppenadresse für mehrere Empfänger."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'indirizzo dell'altro Mac (indirizzo IP o nome di host), oppure un indirizzo di gruppo multicast per più ricevitori."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La dirección del otro Mac (dirección IP o nombre de equipo), o una dirección de grupo de multidifusión para varios receptores."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'émetteur avait %lld voies la dernière fois. Le récepteur s'adapte dès qu'il l'entend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sender had %lld channels last time. The receiver adapts as soon as it hears it."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Sender hatte beim letzten Mal %lld Kanäle. Der Empfänger passt sich an, sobald er ihn hört."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'ultima volta il trasmettitore aveva %lld canali. Il ricevitore si adatta appena lo sente."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La última vez el emisor tenía %lld canales. El receptor se adapta en cuanto lo oye."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'émetteur envoie %lld voies en ce moment : elles sont toutes reçues.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sender is sending %lld channels right now: all of them are received."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Sender sendet gerade %lld Kanäle: Alle werden empfangen."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il trasmettitore sta inviando %lld canali: vengono ricevuti tutti."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El emisor está enviando %lld canales en este momento: se reciben todos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'émetteur est trouvé : réglage du tampon et du rééchantillonneur…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sender is found: adjusting the buffer and the resampler…"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Sender wurde gefunden: Puffer und Resampler werden eingestellt …"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trasmettitore trovato: regolazione del buffer e del ricampionatore…"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Emisor encontrado: ajustando el búfer y el remuestreador…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'émetteur n'envoie que %lld voies.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sender only sends %lld channels."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Sender sendet nur %lld Kanäle."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il trasmettitore invia solo %lld canali."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El emisor solo envía %lld canales."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L'émetteur ne reçoit aucun retour du récepteur : l'état et la marge du lien se lisent **sur le Mac qui reçoit**. Si le son se coupe à l'arrivée, c'est là-bas que le tampon se règle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sender gets no feedback from the receiver: the state and the margin of the link are read **on the Mac that receives**. If the sound cuts out at the other end, that is where the buffer is adjusted."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Sender erhält keine Rückmeldung vom Empfänger: Zustand und Reserve der Verbindung werden **auf dem empfangenden Mac** abgelesen. Wenn der Ton am Ziel aussetzt, wird der Puffer dort eingestellt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il trasmettitore non riceve alcun riscontro dal ricevitore: lo stato e il margine del collegamento si leggono **sul Mac che riceve**. Se l'audio si interrompe all'arrivo, è lì che si regola il buffer."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El emisor no recibe ninguna respuesta del receptor: el estado y el margen del enlace se leen **en el Mac que recibe**. Si el sonido se corta en el destino, es allí donde se ajusta el búfer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latence ajoutée : %@ ms (%lld échantillons à %@ Hz). Automatique : %lld.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Added latency: %@ ms (%lld samples at %@ Hz). Automatic: %lld."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zusätzliche Latenz: %@ ms (%lld Samples bei %@ Hz). Automatisch: %lld."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latenza aggiunta: %@ ms (%lld campioni a %@ Hz). Automatico: %lld."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latencia añadida: %@ ms (%lld muestras a %@ Hz). Automático: %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Latence ajoutée : %lld échantillons.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Added latency: %lld samples."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zusätzliche Latenz: %lld Samples."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latenza aggiunta: %lld campioni."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Latencia añadida: %lld muestras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le format envoyé, et la réserve de tampon du récepteur.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The format sent, and the receiver's buffer reserve."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das gesendete Format und die Pufferreserve des Empfängers."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il formato inviato e la riserva di buffer del ricevitore."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El formato enviado y la reserva de búfer del receptor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le programme n'a pas pu démarrer": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The program could not start"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Programm konnte nicht starten"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il programma non è riuscito ad avviarsi"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El programa no pudo iniciarse"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le réseau est irrégulier : le tampon est déjà celui que la période demande.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The network is irregular: the buffer is already what the period calls for."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Netzwerk ist unregelmäßig: Der Puffer entspricht bereits dem, was die Periode verlangt."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La rete è irregolare: il buffer è già quello richiesto dal periodo."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La red es irregular: el búfer ya es el que pide el periodo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Le tampon absorbe les retards du réseau.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The buffer absorbs the delays of the network."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Puffer fängt die Verzögerungen des Netzwerks auf."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Il buffer assorbe i ritardi della rete."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El búfer absorbe los retrasos de la red."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les branchements sont mémorisés. Ils sont refaits dès que la liaison démarre.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connections are remembered. They are made again as soon as the link starts."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindungen werden gemerkt. Sie werden wiederhergestellt, sobald die Verbindung startet."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I collegamenti vengono memorizzati. Vengono rifatti non appena il collegamento parte."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Las conexiones se recuerdan. Se rehacen en cuanto el enlace arranca."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Les deux à la fois": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both at once"
